<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Teacher's Day - Miss Sana</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{
  min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  overflow:hidden;font-family:"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#063b25,#087f3d,#20a85a,#b8f5c8);
  background-size:400% 400%;animation:bg 10s ease infinite;
}
@keyframes bg{0%{background-position:0 50%}50%{background-position:100% 50%}100%{background-position:0 50%}}
.card{
  position:relative;width:min(92%,720px);padding:48px 32px;
  text-align:center;color:white;border-radius:32px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);
  backdrop-filter:blur(16px);box-shadow:0 25px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.28);
  animation:appear 1.1s ease;z-index:2;
}
@keyframes appear{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(35px) scale(.95)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.flower{font-size:55px;animation:float 3s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes float{50%{transform:translateY(-9px) rotate(4deg)}}
h1{font-size:clamp(38px,8vw,64px);margin:12px 0 8px;text-shadow:0 4px 18px #034c2a}
h2{font-size:clamp(25px,5vw,38px);color:#eaffef;margin-bottom:20px}
.intro{font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;color:#f1fff5}
.from{margin-top:22px;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold}
.gift{
  margin-top:27px;padding:15px 30px;border:0;border-radius:35px;
  background:#fff;color:#08733a;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;
  cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
  transition:.25s;
}
.gift:hover{transform:translateY(-3px) scale(1.04)}
.lessons{
  display:none;margin-top:25px;gap:12px;flex-direction:column;
  animation:reveal .7s ease;
}
.lessons.show{display:flex}
@keyframes reveal{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.lesson{
  padding:14px 18px;border-radius:18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.17);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;
}
.lesson b{font-size:20px}
.particle{position:absolute;font-size:28px;opacity:.65;animation:rise linear infinite}
@keyframes rise{from{transform:translateY(110vh) rotate(0)}to{transform:translateY(-120vh) rotate(360deg)}}
.p1{left:7%;animation-duration:10s}.p2{left:24%;animation-duration:13s;animation-delay:2s}
.p3{right:20%;animation-duration:11s;animation-delay:1s}.p4{right:6%;animation-duration:14s;animation-delay:4s}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="particle p1">🍃</div>
<div class="particle p2">✨</div>
<div class="particle p3">🌿</div>
<div class="particle p4">💚</div>

<main class="card">
  <div class="flower">🌷</div>
  <h1>Happy Teacher's Day!</h1>
  <h2>Dear Miss Sana 💚</h2>

  <p class="intro">
    Thank you for being a wonderful teacher and for giving us
    lessons that go far beyond the classroom.
    <br>
    Your guidance inspires us to become stronger, kinder and better every day.
  </p>

  <p class="from">With Respect & Gratitude,<br>— Abdullah</p>

  <button class="gift" onclick="openGift()">🎁 Open Your Gift</button>

  <div class="lessons" id="lessons">
    <div class="lesson">🦁 <b>Bravery</b><br>To face challenges with courage and never give up.</div>
    <div class="lesson">🌱 <b>Patience</b><br>To keep learning, keep trying, and trust the process.</div>
    <div class="lesson">✨ <b>Inspiration</b><br>To believe in ourselves and inspire others through our actions.</div>
    <div class="lesson">💚 <b>Thank You, Miss Sana!</b><br>These are lessons we will carry with us wherever we go.</div>
  </div>
</main>

<script>
function openGift(){
  const lessons=document.getElementById("lessons");
  lessons.classList.toggle("show");
  document.querySelector(".gift").textContent =
    lessons.classList.contains("show") ? "💚 Close Gift" : "🎁 Open Your Gift";
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
